OL,3,GNEWSA'Heavy congestion' expected during
OL,4,Abridge closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has warned of heavy road
OL,7,Fcongestion when a key bridge across the
OL,8,FRiver Tyne closes for 10 days at the
OL,9,Fend of the week.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council said Tyne Bridge
OL,12,Fwill be completely closed to all
OL,13,Fvehicles, as well as pedestrians and
OL,14,Fcyclists, between 23 October and 2
OL,15,FNovember, with dense traffic likely on
OL,16,Fboth sides of the river
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
