OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Heavy congestion' expected during
OL,4,Abridge closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure will allow scaffolding to
OL,7,Fbe constructed above the road -
OL,8,Feffectively forming a tunnel across the
OL,9,Fbridge - to allow engineers to work
OL,10,Fwithout impeding traffic when they
OL,11,Frestore its main arch early next year.
OL,13,FWorkers aim to complete around 70% of
OL,14,Fthe scaffolding, with the remainder
OL,15,Fscheduled during weekday overnight
OL,16,Fclosures for a further four weeks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
